4: //   e2e:  <spec-stem>::<fragment> — a spec named <stem>.spec.js exists
5: //         under some slice's e2e_specs role, and the fragment appears
6: //         verbatim in it (kit TEST-RULES: fragments are addressed by
7: //         storymap refs and must appear in the file).
