The sim layer works: hosted 10 hops with DNS ledger (miss → authoritative fill, hit → cachedHits with no authoritative consult — authoritativeHits stayed 1), NX ends at hop 3 with browser rendering NX, host-less 8 hops with no DNS consult.

One observation: NX trace — "no GET emitted" ✓ (lastExchange is from the earlier trace, served stays 2).

Also note the snapshot.dns is the full object (router is snapshot object too). Good.

Now the panel layer. Start with model.js changes:
- TOTAL_HOPS add 6: 10
- totalHops: prefer trace.totalHops
- hopSentences stage 6
- labels: dnsStatsLabel, dnsEntries, routerStatsLabel

Rewrite hopSentences: extract stage-5 builder with denom. Current stage-5 branch is big; let me restructure:

```js
